OL,3,GNEWSASara Sharif's grandfather granted
OL,4,Aguardianship of her siblings in
OL,5,APakistan
OL,6,
OL,7,FSara Sharif's paternal grandfather has
OL,8,Fbeen granted guardianship of her
OL,9,Fsiblings by a court in Pakistan.
OL,11,FThe decision comes after years of legal
OL,12,Flimbo following the murder of
OL,13,F10-year-old Sara by her father and
OL,14,Fstepmother in 2023.
OL,16,FAll five children, who are now aged
OL,17,Fbetween 16 and four, have been living
OL,18,Fin Pakistan since 2023. They were asked
OL,19,Fto speak to the judge in court, where
OL,20,Fthe eldest said they were comfortable
OL,21,Fand the siblings were settled.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
