OL,3,GNEWSASara Sharif's grandfather granted
OL,4,Aguardianship of her siblings in
OL,5,APakistan
OL,6,
OL,7,FSara's grandfather, Muhammed Sharif,
OL,8,Ftold the BBC he was relieved to be
OL,9,Fgranted guardianship after three years
OL,10,Fof legal battles, saying his hope is
OL,11,Fthat the children "stay healthy" and
OL,12,Freceive "a good education".
